        "note": "Tempus xE 2022 pindel complex call (GRCh37 4:155244425, lifted ungapped). The vendor allele also contains two homozygous germline variants (rs140019361 GTTT contraction; rs12500437 p.P1342H). The only candidate somatic changes, chr4:154323312 T>A (c.4036A>T p.K1346*) and 154323314 A>C (c.4034T>G p.L1345R), are absent from all other tumor sequencing (0/576 reads BostonGene T0 WES, 0/95 Personalis T0 WGS, 0 at T1/T2) and seen in 1 read of Tempus's own tumor BAM. Probably a Tempus artefact; read counts not available."
