        "genomic_ref_context": "TCGAAGACCTGGGCT",
        "refseq_id": "NM_002374",
        "variant_type": "delins",
        "protein_change": "p.Leu867fs",
        "note": "One complex event, NM_002374.4:c.2599_2630delinsAGGG p.(Leu867ArgfsTer39); minimal VCF form chr2:209694769 CTGGGCTACTGTGTGTTCAATAAGTACACAGT>AGGG, written here anchored at 209694768. Tempus (freebayes/pindel) and DRAGEN call it as one delins; CeGaT (c.2599C>A + c.2600T>G + c.2603_2630del) and oncoanalyser (CT>AG at 209694769 + 28-bp deletion at 209694772) split it; sarek Mutect2 emits three phased records (22-bp del + GTACACA>G + T>G, FILTER clustered_events;haplotype), the first of which was previously stored here. The mRNA and JLF peptides derive from this allele."
      },
