        "variant_type": "insertion",
        "protein_change": "p.Trp70_Gln71ins(14)",
        "note": "Tempus pindel GRCh37 3:197880130 G>G+42 (5/39 tumor reads, 0/30 normal), lifted to GRCh38 chr3:198153259. The site is the germline-polymorphic CAG repeat rs56683636, where the patient's normal DNA is heterozygous for 6-bp and 9-bp deletions, so this is a low-confidence Tempus-only call; the allele is not countable by the site pileup. Protein caveat: NCBI has suppressed NM_001145248.1 (support for the transcript but not for the protein) and now annotates FAM157A as non-coding (NR_146164.1, whose exon 1 contains this insertion), so p.W70_Q71ins(14) derives from a retired protein model and is not supported by current annotation."
      },
